{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_06_beg","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_06","title":"被包圍者","storyCode":"NL-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"fe3894e5032ea35ecb298755cb70f0cd3f83d4543b1b93f95e4c08a3609c1809","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"負責吸引無胄盟的艾沃娜遭到了青金莫妮克的直接襲擊。而神秘的老騎士也找到了瑪恩納，監正會似乎對今晚即將發生的事情瞭若指掌——大騎士領陷入了黑暗。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 6-1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開始了。感染者的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們真的會主動撞槍口上來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們最好會。我們把動靜鬧大一點，董事會抓不住我們的把柄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動力爐那邊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在質疑我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以殺掉野鬃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然，事已至此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有幾個獵物的話，飼主也不會大發雷霆了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來，就是從我手底下逃走的獵物......我只是取回我早該得到的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知第三小隊，收隊，跟我走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"發現野鬃！發現——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太慢了，無胄盟！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在暗處耍陰招，你們已經忘了該怎麼對付騎士了嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"該死的感染者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了傑米，和那些死在你們手裡的無辜者！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"咿——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"——艾沃娜！別忘了索娜說的，不要隨意下殺手......至少，在殺他們的時候，做好覺悟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......無胄盟，你殺過多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"道貌岸然才能讓你們自詡正義嗎？小鬼頭？我在黃金草原當賞金獵人的時候，可從來沒想過這個問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了城市之外的地方，卡西米爾人是怎麼活著的了嗎？很簡單的道理！最強大的求生者全是冷酷的混帳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——隨你怎麼說，無胄盟，但現在，是我贏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"輸了，死了，說什麼都是徒勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他剛才應該已經發出了求救信號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望能把無胄盟吸引過來，不要干擾到格蕾納蒂的行動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"遠牙，你那邊發現無胄盟了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那邊呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾納蒂已經就位了，只等我們的信號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，無胄盟的反應速度不會這麼慢......他們真的有被野鬃吸引過去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發現無胄盟小隊，他們從四號大街的小巷進入了你的包圍網，艾沃娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾沃娜？聽得見嗎？艾沃娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！？瑟奇亞克？艾沃娜！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通訊......被......截斷了？不可能......在信號這麼密集的城市裡......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"安靜得有些可怕......艾沃娜，我有不好的預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟真的會被我們伏擊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，剛才開始我就接不到查絲汀娜的通訊了，她應該在高點盯著我們這片才對——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（惡寒）——————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——快跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然之間，艾沃娜感到了一股足以讓人當場嘔吐的窒息感。\n她不確定這種感覺真的是生理反應，還是某種毒素或法術的效果。\n有一道人影從高樓的頂端一躍而下。\n落在地上，卻像輕輕蒙上的紗布一般，沒有發出分毫聲響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......從那麼高的地方跳下來，連動靜都沒有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們菲林都是這麼方便的生物嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......第三小隊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"這些傢伙——什麼時候！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（和剛才的那些無胄盟有質的差距......這傢伙，藍色的，是上次那個青金嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"可是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要活下來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，根本沒看到她拉弓——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"青色的無胄盟保持著單手投擲的姿勢。\n她冷漠的面龐上閃過一絲不悅，因這場捕獵遊戲有一個不吉利的開端而不悅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......用，投的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊，我的腿，我的腿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咬牙，繼續跑！別停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，別瞎看了，我還在這裡呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染者都是些傻子嗎。數數看這裡有幾把弩對著你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"野鬃騎士，本來你好幾天前就該死了，不過正好，今天你還有一個逞英雄的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑吧，我也不想這麼無趣地結束這場獵殺。打發打發時間也好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你好像誤會了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看起來像是一直四處逃竄的那類人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你像是自尋死路的那類人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啐，感染者已經厭倦了這種苟且偷生的日子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟，你們只是一些躲在商業聯合會背後做著齷齪勾當的傢伙，這裡坦蕩活著的每一個人都比你們要更強！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"要記住他們每一個人的臉......！\n記住......那些騎士......那些卡西米爾人......這些陰狠的兇手......\n別放過，他們任何一個......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......無胄盟渣滓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你和垂死的鉗獸戰鬥過嗎？無胄盟？你知道那些自知命不久矣的畜生，是怎麼戰鬥的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自不量力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許我會死，但我不會輸，你們，一定會在這裡付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後......我的夥伴們，將會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看你那張心存死志的臉，不想活下去的人還想著要贏，簡直是天方夜譚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"青色的無胄盟從背後抽出了一支箭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......用箭矢當劍嗎？你在小看我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你這......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你引以為豪的“速度”嗎？庫蘭塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別小看我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別叫這麼慘啊，我避開了要害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看你能流多少的血吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你的血塗滿街道，那些躲在暗處的感染者，也就不敢反抗了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......青金閣下，她畢竟是個感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......擔心被感染，那就別來做這份工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等她的怒火被死亡撲滅，處理那些感染者的反抗就會輕鬆許多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......查絲汀娜為什麼這麼久沒有通訊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會遇到了什麼麻煩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"無論發生了什麼，還有五分鐘就到我們突襲的時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜也應該抵達位置了，現在，我們只能相信彼此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......時間就快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，要平安無事啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒撐幾分鐘啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......繼續前進吧，感染者的窩點在這附近有七八個，但也許已經撤離了，一個個搜索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別......走啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒，結束......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她就交給你們了，我不想浪費時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"各單位準備，處決她——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是說了，還沒——結束嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"——她還有力氣反擊！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想殺太多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老人和孩子，可以走。但是，留下十個感染者騎士的性命，我要回去交差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你這......劊子手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你把艾沃娜怎麼了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......按理說早該失血昏倒了，不過聽動靜，好像還在反抗呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"——你這魔鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們應該知道，就算逃過今天，也沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜歡說廢話。重複一遍，十個感染者騎士的命，換其他所有人的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我們憑什麼相信你們！？你們不過是一群殺人狂，一群變態罷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算上艾沃娜，只需要九個騎士的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有勝算嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，還是我自己動手快點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別急啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的只是為了給上頭交差，我想，品質比數量更重要吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......托蘭·卡什。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我自吹，我大概在通緝令上還挺值錢的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你願意獻上首級，那今夜我確實不需要其他人的性命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"別挑釁她！托蘭！她可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟的“青金大位”莫妮克閣下，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我說過，我討厭打擾我工作的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，如果你不打算乖乖去死，那就是第三次了，托蘭·卡什。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"負傷的感染者騎士沒有看清發生了什麼。\n等鼓膜反應過來的時候，聽見了尖銳的碰撞聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咻~拉弓速度確實有些離譜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你竟然看見了？不，你的架勢，那是騎士的劍法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賞金獵人何時懂得這種東西了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說嘛，如果只會放放冷箭，設設陷阱，耍耍陰謀詭計，等著獵物上鉤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那和下賤的無胄盟有什麼區別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你躲不開太多次的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦，差點差點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你可要小心一點腳下哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......爆破物陷阱嗎，說到底還不是賞金獵人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是廢話嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——衝鋒......你接受過騎士訓練？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，難怪你會特地幫助臨光家族......你和臨光家族有牽連。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然讓人很感興趣，但是，工作是工作。我們可不能浪費太多時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"......特錦賽期間，叫車真麻煩啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，請問一下好樂得騎士紀念品商店往哪走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"都這麼晚了？我們找個地方吃飯吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"看啊！看啊！來自哥倫比亞的小將再度將藤蘿騎士壓制！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"出色的速度！後來居上——慢著、慢著！發生了什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢相信！！竟然在最後一段衝刺發生了這麼嚴重的意外！？摔倒？拜託，這可是特錦賽的現場！快振作起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"平時下班都這麼晚嗎？瑪恩納？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......您怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"早說一聲，我應該接待您才是，羅素閣下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不勞你費心了，我很快就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜不會平靜，會有不少事情需要處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪恩納，那個提劍遠遊的遊俠回來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穿過屍骸堆砌的戰場與無垠廢土，被炮火焚燒的要塞盡頭，那個遊俠還沒有回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"——還沒有收到聯絡，但是我們已經等不了了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"五分鐘內，我們要突襲並切斷核心電力源，確保商業聯合會所在的核心城區失去電力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這樣，索娜才有潛入商業聯合會的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......玩挺大的啊，我喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......監正會的“朋友”應該已經秘密調走了這裡的安保，避免任何武力衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"速度要快，準備行動——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼！？哪裡的爆炸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"能、能源區？為什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫！為什麼要提前行動！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們根本還沒衝進去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——被算計了，快撤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡吧，卡瓦萊利亞基，我心愛的大騎士領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
